playstation-5-xbox-series-s-x-console-hardware-sales-gta-6", "date": "2026-11-26T09:40:10Z"}]}, {"text": "The first GTA 6 update is live on PS5 and Xbox Series X|S. It includes several bug fixes and a weather system fix.", "label": "reported", "sources": [{"name": "IGN", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uyIxPE7rHaE", "date": "2026-11-23T22:29:25Z"}]}, {"text": "A leaked Xbox build of GTA 6 has been posted. An open source project says it boots on Windows but runs at about 1 frame per second, so it is not playable.", "label": "reported", "sources": [{"name": "Make Tech Easier", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE4ydmpITXZtb2hsYjMxZ3lha0s0WlJ3YUhkc1JmeG1wSC0ySzJLSmZnVTR0b2xvM3NOUmYxdFM1S3M1aVdyWVdBUmtKTnBIMS1OU3JRQlFBdEJyNkRRdllrWC0yaXpOWGFKVGtjc3I4dXhORjZOMDRN?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-26T04:23:24Z"}]}, {"text": "Unofficial PC port work is moving fast. One report says it runs at 24 FPS and uses 10 GB of RAM. Rockstar has not given official PC dates.", "label": "rumour", "sources": [{"name": "OpenCritic", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQclBtejlONWRqc0oyMENTeTJkSmdXeEU0SG5Yak9UMUhPQ25xMWI1blZ0TUI3bHF0U05ONGl3aVdkeE9WZUlWSE50cGloaFV0NFowVE9DbDIwbXcwRGw1V1BsTGE5RUxXWjJNaWprV1EzeDV6OTJQWDA5OUJKRWhKRXBWTVZhc3dyLTJnSWJTZC1ZZw?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-26T08:41:37Z"}, {"name": "GameGPU", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOejM5S0diejRRd045dVgwbWJvTERXQWU1V1I1dGJqcUI0QjRGOVFRampyU1BRZFB4RUI1QUs2X3gtOVF2UzM3NGpJLUZ2UWtCUlhIMm15QkVUZGZiZ0pnUDVTZnBCbWotUGQzbXNWVFlxLTJWc3N2WHVjcUNYUERKYklGMk5jR1F1enNHRjFqQlpWSjFtSjVqcDMySmhPc2VBZzUzTUp1cXMxdXNaM19vN3hodFMwVnVnd0gyZA?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-26T07:32:07Z"}, {"name": "shattered.io", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNODVMa09Na1hpbkpMbkFzQlN4aC1fQkVwQW9WUG9YQzFIanZ0N0FMTWh6b3BlMHl1VmJqNXl4ZkotLTJoTmJ4VVUtcWtBYTV1eEhXR0dBRlBhal9OTUY2N1o4a19iU0NQdE9pNTRLdnRXc1JNMDJLamJDUGJ0T2xrRWxQM1FETnEzMWNCNTFoMHFrN0da?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-26